@startuml clock_port
!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 150
skinparam ranksep 200
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title Pluggable Port Pattern\nClock_Port (Time Sources) + Timezone_Port (tzif)

package "Application Layer" as Application #E8F5E9 {

  package "Ports" as Ports {
    interface "Clock_Port" as ClockPort <<signature>> #FFFF99 {
      **Time Source Abstraction**
      --
      + Now() : Result[Instant]
      + Now_Monotonic() : Result[Monotonic_Instant]
      --
      <i>Generic formal package</i>
    }

    interface "Timezone_Port" as TimezonePort <<signature>> #FFFF99 {
      **Timezone Data Abstraction**
      --
      + Get_UTC_Offset(Instant, Zone) : Result[Offset]
      + To_Civil(Zoned) : Civil
      + To_Zoned(Civil, Zone) : Result[Zoned]
      + Is_Valid_Zone(Zone) : Boolean
      --
      <i>tzif is single source of truth</i>
    }
  }

  package "Use Cases" as UseCases {
    class "Generic_Now" as GenericNow <<generic>> {
      generic (Clock : Clock_Port)
      --
      + Execute() : Result[Instant]
    }

    class "Generic_Now_Zoned" as GenericNowZoned <<generic>> {
      generic (Clock : Clock_Port,
               TZ : Timezone_Port)
      --
      + Execute(Zone : Zone_ID) : Result[Zoned]
    }

    class "Generic_To_Civil" as GenericToCivil <<generic>> {
      generic (TZ : Timezone_Port)
      --
      + Execute(Z : Zoned) : Civil
    }
  }

  GenericNow ..> ClockPort : uses
  GenericNowZoned ..> ClockPort : uses
  GenericNowZoned ..> TimezonePort : uses
  GenericToCivil ..> TimezonePort : uses
}

package "Infrastructure Layer" as Infrastructure #E6F3FF {

  package "Clock Adapters" as ClockAdapters {

    class "Desktop_Clock" as DesktopClock <<adapter>> #90EE90 {
      **Standard Ada Runtime**
      --
      + Now() : Result[Instant]
      + Now_Monotonic() : Result[Monotonic_Instant]
      --
      <i>Uses Ada.Calendar</i>
      <i>Uses Ada.Real_Time</i>
    }

    class "STM32F769I_Clock" as STM32Clock <<adapter>> #FFB6C1 {
      **Embedded Reference**
      --
      + Now() : Result[Instant]
      + Now_Monotonic() : Result[Monotonic_Instant]
      --
      <i>Reads RTC registers</i>
      <i>Uses SysTick</i>
    }

    class "Mock_Clock" as MockClock <<adapter>> #E6E6FA {
      **Testing Support**
      --
      + Set_Time(Instant)
      + Advance(Duration)
      + Now() : Result[Instant]
    }
  }

  package "Timezone Adapters" as TZAdapters {

    class "Tzif_Adapter" as TzifAdapter <<adapter>> #FFD700 {
      **tzif Crate Integration**
      --
      + Get_UTC_Offset(Instant, Zone) : Result[Offset]
      + To_Civil(Zoned) : Civil
      + To_Zoned(Civil, Zone) : Result[Zoned]
      + Is_Valid_Zone(Zone) : Boolean
      --
      <i>Wraps tzif crate</i>
      <i>Single source of truth</i>
      <i>for all timezone data</i>
    }
  }

  DesktopClock .up.|> ClockPort : implements
  STM32Clock .up.|> ClockPort : implements
  MockClock .up.|> ClockPort : implements
  TzifAdapter .up.|> TimezonePort : implements
}

package "API Layer" as API #FFEBCD {

  class "API.Desktop" as APIDesktop <<composition root>> {
    **Desktop Entry Point**
    --
    + Now() : Result[Instant]
    + Now_Zoned(Zone) : Result[Zoned]
    + Now_UTC() : Result[Zoned]
    + To_Civil(Zoned) : Civil
    --
    <i>Wires Desktop_Clock</i>
    <i>Wires Tzif_Adapter</i>
  }

  class "API.Operations" as APIOperations <<SPARK-safe>> #98FB98 {
    **Pure Operations**
    --
    + Add(Instant, Duration) : Result[Instant]
    + Diff(Instant, Instant) : Duration
    --
    <i>No ports needed</i>
    <i>SPARK verifiable</i>
  }
}

APIDesktop -down-> DesktopClock : wires
APIDesktop -down-> TzifAdapter : wires
APIDesktop -down-> GenericNowZoned : instantiates
APIDesktop -down-> GenericToCivil : instantiates

note right of TimezonePort
  **tzif as Single Source of Truth**
  ══════════════════════════════════
  • All timezone data from tzif crate
  • No cached offsets in Domain
  • Consistent DST gap/overlap handling
  • Zone validation against IANA database
end note

note bottom of TzifAdapter
  **External Dependency**
  ════════════════════════
  • tzif crate provides:
    - TZif file parsing
    - UTC offset lookup
    - DST transition detection
  • Infrastructure isolates
    this dependency
end note

legend right
  **Two Pluggable Ports**
  ═══════════════════════════════════

  **Clock_Port** (Time Source)
  What time is it now?
  → Desktop_Clock (Ada.Calendar)
  → STM32F769I_Clock (RTC hardware)
  → Mock_Clock (testing)

  **Timezone_Port** (Timezone Data)
  What's the offset/civil time?
  → Tzif_Adapter (tzif crate)
  Single implementation, but port
  pattern enables future alternatives.

  **Design Principle**
  ═══════════════════════════════════
  Domain layer is PURE:
  - No time source dependency
  - No timezone data dependency
  - Zoned = Instant + Zone_ID only

  Application layer uses ports:
  - To_Civil needs Timezone_Port
  - Now_Zoned needs both ports
endlegend

@enduml
